    & ('geqr', ['GEQR: computes a QR factorization of a complex M-by-N matrix A:', 'A = Q * ( R ),', '( 0 )', 'where:', 'Q is a M-by-M orthogonal matrix;', 'R is an upper-triangular N-by-N matrix;', '0 is a (M-N)-by-N zero matrix, if M > N.'], &
