    & ('orbdb2', ['ORBDB2: simultaneously bidiagonalizes the blocks of a tall and skinny', 'matrix X with orthonomal columns:', '[ B11 ]', '[ X11 ]   [ P1 |    ] [  0  ]', '[-----] = [---------] [-----] Q1**T .', '[ X21 ]   [    | P2 ] [ B21 ]', '[  0  ]', 'X11 is P-by-Q, and X21 is (M-P)-by-Q. P must be no larger than M-P,', 'Q, or M-Q. Routines DORBDB1, DORBDB3, and DORBDB4 handle cases in', 'which P is not the minimum dimension.', 'The orthogonal matrices P1, P2, and Q1 are P-by-P, (M-P)-by-(M-P),', 'and (M-Q)-by-(M-Q), respectively. They are represented implicitly by', 'Householder vectors.', 'B11 and B12 are P-by-P bidiagonal matrices represented implicitly by', 'angles THETA, PHI.'], &
    &  [('dorbdb2', 'dorbdb2', 'real'), ('qorbdb2', 'qorbdb2', None), ('sorbdb2', 'sorbdb2', 'real'), ('xorbdb2', 'xorbdb2', None)], &
