    & ('pbequ', ['PBEQU: computes row and column scalings intended to equilibrate a', 'Hermitian positive definite band matrix A and reduce its condition', 'number (with respect to the two-norm).  S contains the scale factors,', 'S(i) = 1/sqrt(A(i,i)), chosen so that the scaled matrix B with', 'elements B(i,j) = S(i)*A(i,j)*S(j) has ones on the diagonal.  This', 'choice of S puts the condition number of B within a factor N of the', 'smallest possible condition number over all possible diagonal', 'scalings.'], &
